{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122132369913359074%20-%20%0A%09Last%20week%2C%20I%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20participate%20in%20the%20Association%20of%20Minnesota%20Counties%20%28AMC%29%20Fall%20Policy%20Conference%20in%20Bemidji.As%20a%20Benton%20County%20Commissioner%20and%20Chair%20of%20AMC%E2%80%99s%20Public%20Safety%20Policy%20Committee%2C%20I%20spend%20a%20great%20deal%20of%20time%20working%20on%20issues%20that%20affect%20counties%20across%20Minnesota.%20The%20Fall%20Policy%20Conference%20brings%20county%20officials%20together%20for%20important%20conversations%20and%20presentations%20on%20policies%20that%20affect%20Minnesotans%2C%20their%20communities%2C%20and%20their%20wallets.I%20was%20also%20grateful%20to%20AMC%20for%20asking%20me%20to%20participate%20in%20a%20panel%20on%20legislative%20engagement.%20Counties%20work%20with%20legislators%20on%20a%20regular%20basis%2C%20often%20navigating%20challenging%20policy%20discussions%20while%20explaining%20how%20decisions%20made%20in%20St.%20Paul%20affect%20the%20people%20and%20communities%20we%20serve.%20The%20panel%20was%20a%20great%20opportunity%20to%20share%20some%20of%20what%20I%E2%80%99ve%20learned%20through%20that%20work%20and%20hear%20perspectives%20from%20county%20leaders%20across%20Minnesota.We%20also%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20hear%20from%20gubernatorial%20candidate%20Lisa%20Demuth.%20She%20has%20real%20vision%20on%20addressing%20these%20topics%20and%20restoring%20MN.%20Thank%20you%20to%20her%2C%20and%20I%20look%20forward%20to%20serving%20with%20her%20in%20St%20Paul%2C%20helping%20change%20the%20trajectory%20of%20the%20state%20of%20MInnesota.%20Conferences%20like%20this%20are%20valuable%20because%20they%20bring%20local%20leaders%20together%20to%20have%20serious%20conversations%20about%20the%20issues%20we%20deal%20with%20every%20day%E2%80%94from%20public%20safety%20and%20county%20services%20to%20state%20mandates%2C%20funding%2C%20and%20the%20relationship%20between%20counties%20and%20the%20Legislature.I%20appreciate%20AMC%20and%20everyone%20who%20took%20part%20in%20this%20year%E2%80%99s%20conference.%20I%E2%80%99m%20grateful%20for%20the%20opportunity%20to%20represent%20Benton%20County%20in%20these%20statewide%20discussions%20and%20to%20continue%20learning%20from%20county%20leaders%20throughout%20Minnesota.%20www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23MNVotes%20%23GOP%20%23GapinskiforMNSenate%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122133579771359074%20-%20%0A%09We%20need%20to%20take%20a%20serious%20look%20at%20ALL%20programs%20at%20the%20state%20level.Minnesotans%20who%20need%20help%20are%20looking%20for%20a%20hand%20up%2C%20not%20a%20handout.%20At%20the%20same%20time%2C%20we%20need%20to%20dig%20deeper%20into%20funded%20and%20unfunded%20mandates%20pushed%20down%20to%20local%20governments.%20Those%20mandates%20have%20real%20consequences%20for%20taxpayers%20when%20local%20levies%20are%20set%20each%20year.Under%20the%20DFL-led%20trifecta%2C%20Minnesota%20has%20seen%20an%20%2418%20billion%20surplus%20disappear%2C%20billions%20lost%20to%20fraud%2C%20the%20cost%20of%20government%20increase%20by%2040%25%2C%20and%20now%20we%20face%20a%20substantial%20upcoming%20deficit.Whether%20you%E2%80%99re%20red%2C%20blue%2C%20or%20independent%2C%20Minnesotans%20simply%20cannot%20afford%20more%20of%20the%20same.We%20need%20to%20tighten%20the%20purse%20strings.%20We%20need%20to%20cut%20wasteful%20spending.%20We%20need%20to%20get%20serious%20about%20taxes.%20And%20we%20need%20to%20recognize%20that%20while%20people%20sometimes%20need%20a%20hand%20up%2C%20taxpayers%20deserve%20accountability%20for%20where%20their%20hard-earned%20dollars%20are%20going.Government%20may%20not%20be%20a%20business%2C%20but%20it%20still%20has%20a%20responsibility%20to%20operate%20within%20its%20means.%20If%20a%20local%20business%20continually%20spent%20beyond%20what%20it%20could%20sustain%2C%20ignored%20inefficiencies%2C%20and%20failed%20to%20properly%20account%20for%20its%20money%2C%20eventually%20there%20would%20be%20serious%20consequences.%20State%20government%20should%20be%20held%20to%20a%20high%20standard%20of%20fiscal%20responsibility%20as%20well.This%20doesn%E2%80%99t%20have%20to%20be%20complicated.%20We%20need%20to%20bring%20some%20common%20sense%20and%20accountability%20back%20to%20state%20government.If%20money%20were%20no%20object%2C%20we%20could%20fund%20everything.%20Unfortunately%2C%20that%20isn%E2%80%99t%20reality.%20It%E2%80%99s%20time%20for%20a%20serious%20conversation%20about%20our%20priorities%2C%20our%20spending%2C%20and%20what%20Minnesota%20taxpayers%20can%20actually%20afford.www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23BloatedGovernment%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23MNVotes%20%23GOP%20%23GapinskiforMNSenate%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135021751359074%20-%20%0A%09Yesterday%2C%20we%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20take%20part%20in%20the%20Benton%20County%20Board%20Cookout%2C%20where%20we%20helped%20prepare%20and%20serve%20lunch%20for%20the%20hardworking%20employees%20of%20Benton%20County.We%E2%80%99re%20incredibly%20thankful%20for%20the%20men%20and%20women%20who%20show%20up%20every%20day%20to%20serve%20our%20communities%20and%20keep%20county%20services%20running.%20Their%20hard%20work%2C%20dedication%2C%20and%20commitment%20often%20happen%20behind%20the%20scenes%2C%20but%20they%20make%20a%20real%20difference%20in%20the%20lives%20of%20the%20people%20they%20serve.Thank%20you%20to%20all%20of%20our%20Benton%20County%20employees%20for%20everything%20you%20do.%20We%20appreciate%20you%20and%20the%20important%20role%20you%20play%20in%20making%20our%20county%20a%20great%20place%20to%20live%2C%20work%2C%20and%20raise%20a%20family%21%20%09%0A%09"
},
