"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122133579771359074&title=%09We+need+to+take+a+serious+look+at+ALL+programs+at+the+state+level.Minnesotans+who+need+help+are+looking+for+a+hand+up%2C+not+a+handout.+At+the+same+time%2C+we+need+to+dig+deeper+into+funded+and+unfunded+mandates+pushed+down+to+local+governments.+Those+mandates+have+real+consequences+for+taxpayers+when+local+levies+are+set+each+year.Under+the+DFL-led+trifecta%2C+Minnesota+has+seen+an+%2418+billion+surplus+disappear%2C+billions+lost+to+fraud%2C+the+cost+of+government+increase+by+40%25%2C+and+now+we+face+a+substantial+upcoming+deficit.Whether+you%E2%80%99re+red%2C+blue%2C+or+independent%2C+Minnesotans+simply+cannot+afford+more+of+the+same.We+need+to+tighten+the+purse+strings.+We+need+to+cut+wasteful+spending.+We+need+to+get+serious+about+taxes.+And+we+need+to+recognize+that+while+people+sometimes+need+a+hand+up%2C+taxpayers+deserve+accountability+for+where+their+hard-earned+dollars+are+going.Government+may+not+be+a+business%2C+but+it+still+has+a+responsibility+to+operate+within+its+means.+If+a+local+business+continually+spent+beyond+what+it+could+sustain%2C+ignored+inefficiencies%2C+and+failed+to+properly+account+for+its+money%2C+eventually+there+would+be+serious+consequences.+State+government+should+be+held+to+a+high+standard+of+fiscal+responsibility+as+well.This+doesn%E2%80%99t+have+to+be+complicated.+We+need+to+bring+some+common+sense+and+accountability+back+to+state+government.If+money+were+no+object%2C+we+could+fund+everything.+Unfortunately%2C+that+isn%E2%80%99t+reality.+It%E2%80%99s+time+for+a+serious+conversation+about+our+priorities%2C+our+spending%2C+and+what+Minnesota+taxpayers+can+actually+afford.www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23BloatedGovernment+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23MNVotes+%23GOP+%23GapinskiforMNSenate+%09%09"
